        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Cyrus Cylinder</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 539 BCE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Made by</span><span class="info-stat-val">Made in the name of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cyrus-the-great">Cyrus the Great</a> after the Persian conquest of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/babylon">Babylon</a>; the familiar Babylonian wording suggests that Babylonian priests of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/marduk">Marduk</a> composed it at Cyrus's behest</span></div>
